Validation
*After cleaning, validation queries are used to confirm that:
*Required identifiers are populated
*Duplicate business records are controlled
*Review scores are within the valid range of 1–5
*Prices, freight values, and payment values are not negative
*Dates and numeric fields use appropriate data types
*Text categories are standardized

