Skills Demonstrated
SQL | PostgreSQL | Data Cleaning | Data Quality | Data Validation | Data Preparation | GitHub

Dataset Source
The dataset is based on the Brazilian E-Commerce Public Dataset by Olist.
The raw files in this repository are prepared for demonstrating data-cleaning techniques. They should not be represented as untouched source files.

Internship Context
This project was completed as part of a SWYNEX Data Analyst Internship – Data Cleaning & Preparation task and is maintained as a portfolio project demonstrating practical data analytics skills.
